- `.skilled/commands/deep/research.md` — the `/deep:research` loop owner that dispatches one iteration at a time.
- `.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/SKILL.md` — the research-mode packet skill.
- `.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/SKILL.md` — the deep-loop hub this mode is packaged under.
- `.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/SKILL.md` — the packet-scope discipline behind the local-owner research packet rule.

